  unitName: Inferno Sareas
  unitId: 20754
  unitNumber: 1265
  description: An ice archer, and the third imperial prince of Bariura when the empire
    faced the gods' wrath. Versed in the arts of peace as well as war, he easily
    mastered an imperial heirloom magical bow. Known as the "son blessed with heavenly
    beauty," history remembers him as the only court member to be loved and respected
    by citizens during the empire's reign of political terror. However, the diary
    of an assassinated high official describes him as cunning and wicked.
  summonDesc: I'll do my best!<br>I hope I can be of help to you. Um...did I say
    something odd?
  fusionDesc: Thanks, friend!<br>I'm glad you thought of me. I hope that you'll help
    me too...
